  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W47",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周蓝黑霍佳葛重回榜首，也是唯一一套高分占比超过10%的套牌。一场302人的Showcase挑战赛最终由传统蓝白节奏席卷。",
          "en": "Dimir Hogaak returned to the top this week as the only archetype to account for more than 10% of high-scoring decklists. Meanwhile, traditional Azorius Tempo took down the 302-player Showcase Challenge."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "人类学任务也来到了薪传，满编任务的TEG在这场300人SC中拿下八强（deck:5563ff007c4114d5946a）。算是直接给这牌补了一个引擎。",
          "en": "[[card:Anthropological Mission|Anthropological Mission]] has found its way into Legacy too. A TEG list with a full playset reached the Top 8 at that 300-player Showcase (deck:5563ff007c4114d5946a), effectively giving the deck another engine."
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:5563ff007c4114d5946a",
            "label": {
              "zh": "TEG · ZeeSeeKay · 第5名",
              "en": "The Epic Gamble (TEG) · ZeeSeeKay · Rank 5"
            },
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "teg",
              "display_name": "The Epic Gamble (TEG)",
              "event_id": "12858913",
              "deck_id": "5563ff007c4114d5946a",
              "deck_fingerprint_sha256": "e1b980c3cdbeeea92367e919766b1e5769c3cdac8e36e4bbcd161466ba2c57b2",
              "player": "ZeeSeeKay",
              "final_rank": 5,
              "starttime": "2026-11-22 16:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "text": {
          "zh": "还有一套熔炉组合技放了[[card:Crystalline Entity|晶体实体]]进备牌作为卡恩工具箱，也在SC拿下八强（deck:6b430439664f765b3430）。",
          "en": "Mystic Forge Combo also made the Top 8 at the Showcase with [[card:Crystalline Entity|Crystalline Entity]] in the sideboard as a Karn toolbox target (deck:6b430439664f765b3430)."
        },
        "deck_links": [
